    },
    labelBefore: '変更前 (JSON)',
    labelAfter: '変更後 (JSON)',
    compare: '比較',
    clear: 'クリア',
    swap: '入れ替え',
    copy: 'コピー',
    copied: 'コピーしました！',
    copyFailed: 'コピーに失敗しました。再試行してください。',
    patchTitle: 'JSON Patch (RFC 6902)',
    visualTitle: 'ビジュアル差分',
    msgBothRequired: '両方のパネルに有効な JSON を入力してください。',
    msgParseErrorBefore: '変更前 JSON の解析エラー：',
    msgParseErrorAfter: '変更後 JSON の解析エラー：',
    msgNoDiff: '差異なし — JSON は同一です。',
    msgChanges: '{n} 件の変更を検出しました。',
    sideBefore: '変更前',
    sideAfter: '変更後',
    noteSep: '',
    msgLossy: '次の数値は JavaScript で正確に保持できず、丸めた値で比較したため、差分を見落とすことがあり、パッチにも丸めた値を書きます：{list}。',
    msgDup: '次のキーは同じオブジェクト内に複数あります。JSON.parse は最後の値だけを残し、その値だけを比較します：{list}。',
    msgMore: 'ほか {n} 件',
    msgTooDeep: 'JSON の入れ子が深すぎるため、このブラウザーでは比較できません（コールスタック不足）。比較は行っていません。',
  },
  ko: {
    result: "결과",
    hideInputs: "입력 접기",
    showInputs: "입력 펼치기",
    emptyResult: "두 JSON 값을 비교하면 여기에 패치와 시각적 차이가 표시됩니다.",
    tips: {
      compare: "비교를 누르거나 Ctrl+Enter(Mac은 ⌘+Enter)를 누르세요. 양쪽 모두 유효한 JSON이어야 합니다. 요청할 때만 비교하며, 서식과 객체 키 순서는 패치에 영향을 주지 않습니다.",
      clear: "지우기는 양쪽 입력, 결과와 상태를 비웁니다. 도구 안에 포커스가 있으면 Ctrl+L(Mac은 ⌘+L)도 같은 작업을 합니다.",
      swap: "교체는 양쪽 입력을 바꾸고 결과를 지웁니다. 비교를 다시 누르면 역방향 패치를 생성합니다.",
      before: "변경 전 JSON 값을 입력하세요. 객체, 배열, 문자열, 숫자, 불리언과 null을 사용할 수 있습니다. 주석과 후행 쉼표는 허용되지 않습니다. 숫자는 JavaScript 정밀도로 처리합니다.",
      after: "변경된 JSON 값을 입력하세요. 배열은 id 필드 대신 인덱스로 비교합니다. 어느 입력이든 편집하면 이전 결과가 지워지며 자동 비교는 하지 않습니다.",
      patch: "복사는 전체 JSON Patch를 복사합니다. add, remove, replace 작업을 생성하고 경로의 ~는 ~0, /는 ~1로 이스케이프합니다. 배열 삭제는 큰 인덱스부터 실행합니다. 복사가 실패해도 패치는 유지되므로 다시 시도할 수 있습니다.",
      visual: "시각적 차이는 추가를 +, 삭제를 −, 값 변경을 ~로 표시합니다. 점으로 구분한 경로는 읽기용입니다. 코드에서는 패치의 JSON Pointer 경로를 사용하세요. 변경되지 않은 값은 생략합니다.",
      results: "차이가 있으면 입력 접기로 텍스트를 유지하며 결과 공간을 넓힙니다. 입력 펼치기로 편집기를 복원합니다. 값이 같으면 상태만 표시하고 패치를 생성하지 않습니다.",
    },
    labelBefore: '변경 전 (JSON)',
    labelAfter: '변경 후 (JSON)',
    compare: '비교',
    clear: '지우기',
    swap: '교체',
    copy: '복사',
    copied: '복사됨!',
    copyFailed: '복사에 실패했습니다. 다시 시도해 주세요.',
    patchTitle: 'JSON Patch (RFC 6902)',
    visualTitle: '시각적 차이',
    msgBothRequired: '두 패널에 유효한 JSON을 입력해야 합니다.',
    msgParseErrorBefore: '변경 전 JSON 파싱 오류: ',
    msgParseErrorAfter: '변경 후 JSON 파싱 오류: ',
    msgNoDiff: '차이 없음 — JSON 값이 동일합니다.',
    msgChanges: '{n}개 변경 감지됨.',
    sideBefore: '변경 전',
    sideAfter: '변경 후',
    noteSep: ' ',
    msgLossy: '다음 숫자는 JavaScript에서 정확히 표현할 수 없어 반올림한 값으로 비교했습니다. 이 값들의 차이는 놓칠 수 있고 패치에도 반올림한 값을 씁니다: {list}.',
    msgDup: '다음 키는 같은 객체 안에 여러 번 나옵니다. JSON.parse는 마지막 값만 남기며 그 값만 비교합니다: {list}.',
    msgMore: '외 {n}개',
    msgTooDeep: 'JSON 중첩이 너무 깊어 이 브라우저에서 비교할 수 없습니다(호출 스택 부족). 비교하지 않았습니다.',
  },
};

const L = STRINGS[lang];
const TIPS = L.tips;
---
<div
  class="jd-wrap"
  data-msg-both-required={L.msgBothRequired}
  data-msg-parse-error-before={L.msgParseErrorBefore}
  data-msg-parse-error-after={L.msgParseErrorAfter}
  data-msg-no-diff={L.msgNoDiff}
  data-msg-changes={L.msgChanges}
  data-msg-lossy={L.msgLossy}
  data-msg-dup={L.msgDup}
  data-msg-more={L.msgMore}
  data-msg-too-deep={L.msgTooDeep}
  data-side-before={L.sideBefore}
  data-side-after={L.sideAfter}
  data-note-sep={L.noteSep}
  data-copy={L.copy}
  data-copied={L.copied}
  data-copy-failed={L.copyFailed}
>
  <div class="jd-actions">
    <span class="jd-control"><button id="jd-run" class="btn-primary" type="button">{L.compare}</button><Toggletip id="jd-tip-compare" lang={lang} about={L.compare}>{TIPS.compare}</Toggletip></span>
    <span class="jd-control"><button id="jd-clear" class="btn-ghost" type="button">{L.clear}</button><Toggletip id="jd-tip-clear" lang={lang} about={L.clear}>{TIPS.clear}</Toggletip></span>
    <span class="jd-control"><button id="jd-swap" class="btn-secondary" type="button">{L.swap}</button><Toggletip id="jd-tip-swap" lang={lang} about={L.swap}>{TIPS.swap}</Toggletip></span>
  </div>
  <div id="jd-status" class="jd-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div id="jd-inputs" class="jd-inputs zt-compare-inputs">
    <div class="jd-panel zt-io-pane">
      <div class="jd-heading"><label for="jd-left">{L.labelBefore}</label><Toggletip id="jd-tip-before" lang={lang} about={L.labelBefore}>{TIPS.before}</Toggletip></div>
      <textarea id="jd-left" placeholder='{"name": "Alice", "age": 30}' spellcheck="false"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div class="jd-panel zt-io-pane">
      <div class="jd-heading"><label for="jd-right">{L.labelAfter}</label><Toggletip id="jd-tip-after" lang={lang} about={L.labelAfter}>{TIPS.after}</Toggletip></div>
      <textarea id="jd-right" placeholder='{"name": "Alice", "age": 31, "city": "Tokyo"}' spellcheck="false"></textarea>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section id="jd-results" class="jd-results zt-compare-results" data-empty="true" aria-labelledby="jd-result-label">
    <div class="jd-heading">
      <span id="jd-result-label">{L.result}</span><Toggletip id="jd-tip-results" lang={lang} about={L.result}>{TIPS.results}</Toggletip>
      <button id="jd-toggle-inputs" class="btn-ghost" type="button" aria-controls="jd-inputs" aria-expanded="true" data-hide={L.hideInputs} data-show={L.showInputs} disabled>{L.hideInputs}</button>
    </div>
    <p id="jd-empty" class="jd-empty">{L.emptyResult}</p>
    <div id="jd-patch-block" class="jd-output-block" style="display:none">
      <div class="jd-out-label">
        <label for="jd-patch-out">{L.patchTitle}</label><Toggletip id="jd-tip-patch" lang={lang} about={L.patchTitle}>{TIPS.patch}</Toggletip>
        <button id="jd-copy-patch" class="btn-copy" type="button">{L.copy}</button>
      </div>
      <textarea id="jd-patch-out" class="jd-out-area" readonly spellcheck="false"></textarea>
    </div>
    <div id="jd-visual-block" class="jd-output-block" style="display:none">
      <div class="jd-out-label"><span id="jd-visual-label">{L.visualTitle}</span><Toggletip id="jd-tip-visual" lang={lang} about={L.visualTitle}>{TIPS.visual}</Toggletip></div>
      <div id="jd-visual" class="jd-visual" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-labelledby="jd-visual-label"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      /* ── engine:start ── */
      function hasOwn(o, k) { return Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(o, k); }
      function pointerToken(k) { return String(k).replace(/~/g, '~0').replace(/\//g, '~1'); }

      // Deep diff: returns RFC 6902 JSON Patch ops. Paths are RFC 6901 JSON Pointers, where
      // "" is the whole document. Arrays are compared index by index; elements past the end
      // of After are removed from the highest index down, so each remove still finds its
      // target when the operations are applied in order.
      function diff(before, after, path) {
        path = path || '';
        var ops = [];

        if (before === after) return ops;

        if (typeof before !== typeof after ||
            (before === null) !== (after === null) ||
            Array.isArray(before) !== Array.isArray(after)) {
          ops.push({ op: 'replace', path: path, value: after });
          return ops;
        }

        if (Array.isArray(before)) {
          var common = Math.min(before.length, after.length);
          for (var i = 0; i < common; i++) {
            ops = ops.concat(diff(before[i], after[i], path + '/' + i));
          }
          for (var r = before.length - 1; r >= after.length; r--) {
            ops.push({ op: 'remove', path: path + '/' + r });
          }
          for (var a = before.length; a < after.length; a++) {
            ops.push({ op: 'add', path: path + '/' + a, value: after[a] });
          }
          return ops;
        }

        if (before !== null && typeof before === 'object') {
          var keysB = Object.keys(before);
          var keysA = Object.keys(after);
          var allKeys = Array.from(new Set(keysB.concat(keysA)));

          allKeys.forEach(function (k) {
            var childPath = path + '/' + pointerToken(k);
            if (!hasOwn(before, k)) {
              ops.push({ op: 'add', path: childPath, value: after[k] });
            } else if (!hasOwn(after, k)) {
              ops.push({ op: 'remove', path: childPath });
            } else {
              ops = ops.concat(diff(before[k], after[k], childPath));
            }
          });
          return ops;
        }

        // Primitives that differ
        ops.push({ op: 'replace', path: path, value: after });
        return ops;
      }

      // Build visual diff tree lines
      function buildVisual(before, after, path) {
        path = path || '';
        var lines = [];

        if (JSON.stringify(before) === JSON.stringify(after)) return lines;

        if (before !== null && typeof before === 'object' && after !== null && typeof after === 'object' &&
            Array.isArray(before) === Array.isArray(after)) {
          var keysB = Object.keys(before);
          var keysA = Object.keys(after);
          var allKeys = Array.from(new Set(keysB.concat(keysA)));

          allKeys.forEach(function (k) {
            var childPath = (path ? path + '.' : '') + k;
            if (!hasOwn(before, k)) {
              lines.push({ type: 'add', path: childPath, value: after[k] });
            } else if (!hasOwn(after, k)) {
              lines.push({ type: 'remove', path: childPath, value: before[k] });
            } else if (JSON.stringify(before[k]) !== JSON.stringify(after[k])) {
              if (before[k] !== null && typeof before[k] === 'object' &&
                  after[k] !== null && typeof after[k] === 'object') {
                lines = lines.concat(buildVisual(before[k], after[k], childPath));
              } else {
                lines.push({ type: 'change', path: childPath, before: before[k], after: after[k] });
              }
            }
          });
        } else {
          lines.push({ type: 'change', path: path || '(root)', before: before, after: after });
        }
        return lines;
      }

      /* ── engine:end ── */

      /* ── scan:start ── */
      /* JSON.parse rounds numbers that a double cannot hold (9007199254740993, 1e400, long
         decimals) and keeps only the last of two equal keys, so two documents that differ can
         compare as identical. scanJson finds those values in the source text. escSeg, decimalKey,
         isExactNumber and scanJson are copied from json-schema-validator-engine.js;
         test-json-diff.mjs checks that the copies are the same. */
      var MAX_NOTES = 50;
      function escSeg(s) { return String(s).replace(/~/g, '~0').replace(/\//g, '~1'); }
      function decimalKey(raw) {
        var m = /^([+-]?)(\d*)(?:\.(\d*))?(?:[eE]([+-]?\d+))?$/.exec(raw);
        if (!m || (m[2] === '' && !m[3])) return null;
        var frac = m[3] || '';
        var digits = (m[2] + frac).replace(/^0+/, '');
        if (!digits) return '0';
        var exp = (m[4] ? parseInt(m[4], 10) : 0) - frac.length;
        var len = digits.length;
        digits = digits.replace(/0+$/, '');
        exp += len - digits.length;
        return (m[1] === '-' ? '-' : '') + digits + 'e' + exp;
      }
      function isExactNumber(raw, num) {
        if (typeof num !== 'number' || !isFinite(num)) return false;
        if (/^-?(?:0|[1-9]\d{0,14})$/.test(raw)) return true;
        var s = String(raw).replace(/_/g, '');
        var r = /^([+-]?)0([xob])([0-9a-fA-F]+)$/.exec(s);
        if (r) {
          if (!Number.isInteger(num)) return false;
          var big = BigInt('0' + r[2] + r[3]);
          return (r[1] === '-' ? -big : big) === BigInt(num);
        }
        var a = decimalKey(s);
        return a !== null && a === decimalKey(String(num));
      }
      function scanJson(text, want, wantKeys) {
        var res = { spans: {}, keys: {}, dups: [], unsafe: [], lossyCount: 0 };
        var i = 0, n = text.length;
        function ws() { while (i < n) { var c = text.charCodeAt(i); if (c === 32 || c === 9 || c === 10 || c === 13) i++; else break; } }
        function strEnd() { i++; while (i < n) { var c = text.charCodeAt(i); if (c === 34) { i++; return; } i += c === 92 ? 2 : 1; } }
        function readKey(frame) {
          var ks = i; strEnd(); var ke = i;
          var key = JSON.parse(text.slice(ks, ke));
          if (frame.seen[key]) { if (res.dups.length < MAX_NOTES) res.dups.push({ path: frame.ptr, key: key, offset: ks }); }
          else frame.seen[key] = true;
          var kp = frame.ptr + '/' + escSeg(key);
          if (wantKeys && wantKeys[kp]) res.keys[kp] = [ks, ke];
          ws(); i++; ws();
          return kp;
        }
        var stack = [], cur = '';
        ws();
        for (;;) {
          ws();
          var start = i, c = text[i];
          if (c === '{' || c === '[') {
            i++; ws();
            var frame = { obj: c === '{', ptr: cur, n: 0, start: start, seen: c === '{' ? Object.create(null) : null };
            stack.push(frame);
            if (text[i] === (c === '{' ? '}' : ']')) { i++; stack.pop(); if (want && want[frame.ptr] !== undefined) res.spans[frame.ptr] = [start, i]; }
            else { cur = frame.obj ? readKey(frame) : frame.ptr + '/0'; continue; }
          } else {
            if (c === '"') strEnd();
            else {
              while (i < n) { var cc = text.charCodeAt(i); if (cc === 44 || cc === 93 || cc === 125 || cc === 32 || cc === 9 || cc === 10 || cc === 13) break; i++; }
              if (c === '-' || (c >= '0' && c <= '9')) {
                var raw = text.slice(start, i);
                var num = Number(raw);
                if (!isExactNumber(raw, num)) {
                  res.lossyCount++;
                  if (res.unsafe.length < MAX_NOTES) res.unsafe.push({ path: cur, raw: raw, parsed: String(num), offset: start });
                }
              }
            }
            if (want && want[cur] !== undefined) res.spans[cur] = [start, i];
          }
          // unwind
          for (;;) {
            if (!stack.length) return res;
            ws();
            var top = stack[stack.length - 1];
            if (text[i] === ',') {
              i++; ws(); top.n++;
              cur = top.obj ? readKey(top) : top.ptr + '/' + top.n;
              break;
            }
            i++;
            stack.pop();
            if (want && want[top.ptr] !== undefined) res.spans[top.ptr] = [top.start, i];
          }
        }
      }
      /* ── scan:end ── */

      function esc(s) {
        return String(s)
          .replace(/&/g, '&amp;')
          .replace(/</g, '&lt;')
          .replace(/>/g, '&gt;')
          .replace(/"/g, '&quot;');
      }

      function renderValue(v) {
        return '<code>' + esc(JSON.stringify(v)) + '</code>';
      }

      var wrap = document.querySelector('.jd-wrap');
      var i18n = {
        bothRequired: wrap.dataset.msgBothRequired,
        parseErrorBefore: wrap.dataset.msgParseErrorBefore,
        parseErrorAfter: wrap.dataset.msgParseErrorAfter,
        noDiff: wrap.dataset.msgNoDiff,
        changes: wrap.dataset.msgChanges,
        lossy: wrap.dataset.msgLossy,
        dup: wrap.dataset.msgDup,
        more: wrap.dataset.msgMore,
        tooDeep: wrap.dataset.msgTooDeep,
        sideBefore: wrap.dataset.sideBefore,
        sideAfter: wrap.dataset.sideAfter,
        noteSep: wrap.dataset.noteSep || '',
        copy: wrap.dataset.copy,
        copied: wrap.dataset.copied,
        copyFailed: wrap.dataset.copyFailed,
      };

      var statusEl = document.getElementById('jd-status');
      var patchBlock = document.getElementById('jd-patch-block');
      var visualBlock = document.getElementById('jd-visual-block');
      var patchOut = document.getElementById('jd-patch-out');
      var visualEl = document.getElementById('jd-visual');
      var copyButton = document.getElementById('jd-copy-patch');
      var copySequence = 0;
      var lastTracked = null;
      var copyTimer;
      var inputs = document.getElementById('jd-inputs');
      var results = document.getElementById('jd-results');
      var toggleInputs = document.getElementById('jd-toggle-inputs');
      var emptyResult = document.getElementById('jd-empty');

      function resetResult() {
        copySequence++;
        clearTimeout(copyTimer);
        copyButton.textContent = i18n.copy;
        patchOut.value = '';
        visualEl.innerHTML = '';
        patchBlock.style.display = 'none';
        visualBlock.style.display = 'none';
        statusEl.textContent = '';
        statusEl.className = 'jd-status';
        inputs.hidden = false;
        results.setAttribute('data-empty', 'true');
        emptyResult.hidden = false;
        toggleInputs.disabled = true;
        toggleInputs.textContent = toggleInputs.dataset.hide;
        toggleInputs.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
      }

      /* Text appended to the status when JSON.parse changed a value: numbers it rounded and keys
         it collapsed, on either side (first 10, then a count of the rest). '' when there are none. */
      function sourceNote(leftText, rightText) {
        var lossy = [], dups = [], lossyTotal = 0, dupsCapped = false;
        [[leftText, i18n.sideBefore], [rightText, i18n.sideAfter]].forEach(function (pair) {
          var sc = scanJson(pair[0], null, null);
          lossyTotal += sc.lossyCount;
          if (sc.dups.length >= MAX_NOTES) dupsCapped = true;  // scanJson stops recording at MAX_NOTES
          sc.unsafe.forEach(function (x) { lossy.push(pair[1] + ' ' + (x.path || '(root)') + ': ' + x.raw + ' → ' + x.parsed); });
          sc.dups.forEach(function (x) { dups.push(pair[1] + ' ' + x.path + '/' + escSeg(x.key)); });
        });
        function list(items, total, capped) {
          var shown = items.slice(0, 10);
          var rest = total - shown.length;
          return shown.join('; ') + (rest > 0 ? '; ' + i18n.more.replace('{n}', rest + (capped ? '+' : '')) : '');
        }
        var parts = [];
        if (lossy.length) parts.push(i18n.lossy.replace('{list}', list(lossy, lossyTotal, false)));
        if (dups.length) parts.push(i18n.dup.replace('{list}', list(dups, dups.length, dupsCapped)));
        return parts.length ? i18n.noteSep + parts.join(i18n.noteSep) : '';
      }

      function setStatus(msg, isError) {
        statusEl.textContent = msg;
        statusEl.className = 'jd-status ' + (isError ? 'error' : 'success');
      }

      document.getElementById('jd-run').addEventListener('click', function () {
        var leftVal = document.getElementById('jd-left').value.trim();
        var rightVal = document.getElementById('jd-right').value.trim();
        resetResult();

        if (!leftVal || !rightVal) {
          setStatus(i18n.bothRequired, true);
          return;
        }

        var before, after;
        try { before = JSON.parse(leftVal); } catch (e) { setStatus(i18n.parseErrorBefore + e.message, true); return; }
        try { after = JSON.parse(rightVal); } catch (e) { setStatus(i18n.parseErrorAfter + e.message, true); return; }

        var ops, visual, patchText;
        try {
          ops = diff(before, after, '');
          visual = buildVisual(before, after, '');
          patchText = JSON.stringify(ops, null, 2);
        } catch (e) {
          if (!(e instanceof RangeError)) throw e;
          setStatus(i18n.tooDeep, true);
          return;
        }
        var note = sourceNote(leftVal, rightVal);

        if (ops.length === 0) {
          setStatus(i18n.noDiff + note, !!note);
          patchBlock.style.display = 'none';
          visualBlock.style.display = 'none';
          return;
        }

        patchOut.value = patchText;
        patchBlock.style.display = '';

        var html = '';
        visual.forEach(function (line) {
          var sep = line.path ? ': ' : '';
          if (line.type === 'add') {
            html += '<div class="jd-line jd-add"><span class="jd-op">+</span><span class="jd-path">' + esc(line.path) + sep + '</span><span class="jd-val">' + renderValue(line.value) + '</span></div>';
          } else if (line.type === 'remove') {
            html += '<div class="jd-line jd-remove"><span class="jd-op">−</span><span class="jd-path">' + esc(line.path) + sep + '</span><span class="jd-val">' + renderValue(line.value) + '</span></div>';
          } else {
            html += '<div class="jd-line jd-change"><span class="jd-op">~</span><span class="jd-path">' + esc(line.path) + sep + '</span><span class="jd-val jd-before">' + renderValue(line.before) + '</span><span class="jd-arrow"> → </span><span class="jd-val jd-after">' + renderValue(line.after) + '</span></div>';
          }
        });
        visualEl.innerHTML = html;
        visualBlock.style.display = '';
        results.setAttribute('data-empty', 'false');
        emptyResult.hidden = true;
        toggleInputs.disabled = false;
        if (window.matchMedia('(max-width: 640px)').matches && results.getBoundingClientRect().top > window.innerHeight - 96) {
          results.scrollIntoView({ block: 'start', behavior: 'auto' });
        }

        setStatus(i18n.changes.replace('{n}', ops.length) + note, !!note);

        // Analytics: one event per pair of inputs; comparing the same pair again is not sent.
        var trackKey = leftVal + '\u0000' + rightVal;
        if (trackKey !== lastTracked) {
          lastTracked = trackKey;
          window.trackTool && window.trackTool('json-diff', 'diff');
        }
      });

      document.getElementById('jd-copy-patch').addEventListener('click', async function () {
        if (!patchOut.value) return;
        var btn = this;
        var active = ++copySequence;
        clearTimeout(copyTimer);
        btn.textContent = i18n.copy;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(patchOut.value);
          if (active !== copySequence) return;
          btn.textContent = i18n.copied;
          copyTimer = setTimeout(function () { if (active === copySequence) btn.textContent = i18n.copy; }, 1500);
        } catch (e) {
          if (active === copySequence) btn.textContent = i18n.copyFailed;
        }
      });

      toggleInputs.addEventListener('click', function () {
        if (toggleInputs.disabled) return;
        inputs.hidden = !inputs.hidden;
        toggleInputs.textContent = inputs.hidden ? toggleInputs.dataset.show : toggleInputs.dataset.hide;
        toggleInputs.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!inputs.hidden));
      });

      function clearAll() {
        var focusInResults = results.contains(document.activeElement);
        document.getElementById('jd-left').value = '';
        document.getElementById('jd-right').value = '';
        lastTracked = null;
        resetResult();
        if (focusInResults) document.getElementById('jd-left').focus();
      }
      document.getElementById('jd-clear').addEventListener('click', clearAll);
      ['jd-left', 'jd-right'].forEach(function (id) {
        document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('input', resetResult);
      });
      document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
        if ((e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) && (e.key === 'l' || e.key === 'L') && wrap.contains(document.activeElement)) {
          e.preventDefault();
          clearAll();
        }
      });

      document.getElementById('jd-swap').addEventListener('click', function () {
        var l = document.getElementById('jd-left');
        var r = document.getElementById('jd-right');
        var tmp = l.value;
        l.value = r.value;
        r.value = tmp;
        resetResult();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</div>

<style>
  .jd-wrap { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .jd-wrap [hidden] { display: none; }

  .jd-panel { gap: 0.3rem; }
  .jd-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; flex: none; min-height: 2rem; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .jd-heading span { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  #jd-toggle-inputs { margin-left: auto; }
  .jd-panel label { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }

  .jd-panel textarea {
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .jd-panel textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--color-bg); }

  .jd-actions { display: flex; flex: none; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .jd-control { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; }

  .jd-status { flex: none; height: 3rem; overflow: auto; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.4; align-content: center; }
  .jd-status.success { color: #057a55; }
  .jd-status.error { color: #c0392b; }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :global(:root:not([data-theme="light"])) .jd-status.success { color: #34d399; }
    :global(:root:not([data-theme="light"])) .jd-status.error { color: #f87171; }
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .jd-status.success { color: #34d399; }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .jd-status.error { color: #f87171; }

  .jd-results { gap: 0.5rem; }
  .jd-empty { margin: 0; padding: 1.5rem; text-align: center; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .jd-output-block { display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; gap: 0.4rem; }

  .jd-out-label {
    display: flex;
    flex: none;
    min-height: 2rem;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  #jd-copy-patch { margin-left: auto; }

  .jd-out-area {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-height: 0;
    resize: none;
    overflow: auto;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .jd-visual {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: auto;
  }

  .jd-visual:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary); outline-offset: 2px; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .jd-actions button, #jd-toggle-inputs, #jd-copy-patch { min-height: 44px; }
  }

  .jd-visual :global(.jd-line) {
    flex: none;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  :global(.jd-add) { background: #ecfdf5; }
  :global(.jd-remove) { background: #fef2f2; }
  :global(.jd-change) { background: #fffbeb; }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :global(:root:not([data-theme="light"])) :global(.jd-add) { background: #064e3b22; }
    :global(:root:not([data-theme="light"])) :global(.jd-remove) { background: #7f1d1d22; }
    :global(:root:not([data-theme="light"])) :global(.jd-change) { background: #78350f22; }
  }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) :global(.jd-add) { background: #064e3b22; }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) :global(.jd-remove) { background: #7f1d1d22; }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) :global(.jd-change) { background: #78350f22; }

  :global(.jd-op) {
    font-weight: 700;
    min-width: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  :global(.jd-add) :global(.jd-op) { color: #059669; }
  :global(.jd-remove) :global(.jd-op) { color: #dc2626; }
  :global(.jd-change) :global(.jd-op) { color: #d97706; }

  :global(.jd-path) {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  :global(.jd-val) code {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  :global(.jd-before) code { text-decoration: line-through; opacity: 0.6; }
  :global(.jd-after) code { color: #059669; }
  :global([data-theme="dark"]) :global(.jd-after) code { color: #34d399; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :global(:root:not([data-theme="light"])) :global(.jd-after) code { color: #34d399; }
  }

  :global(.jd-arrow) {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    align-self: center;
  }
</style>
